Chiqish yozish: (x aynan: y), yangi-qator.

>> y := x kichik-harflar.
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (x aynan: y), yangi-qator.

>> y := x qirqish.
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (x aynan: y), yangi-qator.

>> y := x surish: 1.
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (x aynan: y), yangi-qator.

>> y := x boshlab: 1 uzunlik: 2.
